    "sceptre": "OSRS Wiki, Pyramid Plunder: Pharaoh's sceptre chance per chest and per sarcophagus, rolled on opening.",
    "chances": "Success chances are the Wiki's charts fitted to the standard skilling roll (1 + floor(low*(99-L)/98 + high*(L-1)/98 + 0.5))/256: urn search 117->181/256 at 21->99, check for snakes 179/256 at 21 and 223/256 at 69, search past a snake and tomb doors 149->221, tomb doors with a lockpick and speartraps 179->251, chests without a swarm 149->221. Urns and doors lose 1/256 per room. Sarcophagi roll on Strength: 60/256 at 1 and 250/256 at 99 in room 1, 10/256 less per room; rooms 7 and 8 are fitted to the Wiki's 'impossible at Strength 1 (room 7) and 1-7 (room 8)'.",
    "prices": "OSRS Wiki, Simon Templeton: what he pays for each artefact."
